    <string name="setup_heading">Rides with the display off</string>
    <string name="setup_intro">So that your ride keeps being recorded with the display off, ElTouro needs these settings. Tap everything marked ✗ once.</string>
    <string name="setup_precise">Precise location</string>
    <string name="setup_notifications">Notifications (ride status)</string>
    <string name="setup_background">Location: allow all the time</string>
    <string name="setup_background_why">Android likes to stop apps while the display is off. With “Allow all the time” ElTouro may pick the ride up again by itself. The app uses your location only while a ride is running – just as before. On the next page, choose “Allow all the time”.</string>
    <string name="setup_battery">Battery optimization off</string>
